SUMMARY:Christine (1983)
LOCATION:Hollywood Theatre\, 4122 NE Sandy Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5315;-122.624
DESCRIPTION:Dir. John Carpenter · 110 min\n\nNerdy high schooler Arnie Cun
 ningham falls for Christine\, a rusty 1958 Plymouth Fury\, and becomes obs
 essed with restoring the classic automobile to her former glory. As the ca
 r changes\, so does Arnie\, whose newfound confidence turns to arrogance b
 ehind the wheel of his exotic beauty. Arnie's girlfriend Leigh and best fr
 iend Dennis reach out to him\, only to be met by a Fury like no other.\n\n
 Tickets: https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/christine-2026-11-13-730pm/\n\
 nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/christine-2026-11-13-730pm/
